N1 B158: apply first-round review fixes

Limit the 升 interchange with 昇 to the two Daijisen senses that note
it, drop the grid sense from the 升 word card, and explain the theatre
box-seat sense with 升席. Give the 升 untagged-support exception a
row-specific justification. Add readings, and JMdict ids where missing,
for compounds named in openings (債権/債券, 偏狭, 人偏, 傍系, 傍流, 元勲,
勲一等, 忘却, 即位), replace 偽's distractor 犬, and guard 偏 against 側,
匿 against 皮, 偏見 against 意見 and 升 against 腰掛け. Note readings
that sources mark as outside the Joyo table.

Refs #60

